  "story": {
    "text": "Emma and Harriet collect {RIDDLES} for a little {BOOK}. Mr. Elton brings them a {CHARADE} addressed “To Miss ——”, and the answer is {COURTSHIP}. Emma is sure it is meant for Harriet, who copies it in with {SHAKING} hands. Mr. Woodhouse, meanwhile, frets that his grandsons’ uncle {TOSSES} them up to the ceiling.",
